  "source_order_argument": [
    "Normal launch entry precedes its RELEASE write/newline/close.",
    "The unique wait_worker call is after successful close, and its own completion is the tW event; qualifying result is exact True.",
    "typed.wait_worker returnsTrue only after process.wait completes; timeout returnsFalse. True does not by itself require exitcode0.",
    "The caller continues cleanup, input/evidence validation and finally writes/closes before normal launch return tF.",
    "With the contract monotonic parent clock, these source events define t0<=tR<=tW<=tF for qualified paths, independent of physical worker exit timing."
  ],
